   ```
   ## 6. FolderEntry

   A subfolder child within folder metadata. Contains ECIES-wrapped keys for accessing the subfolder.

   | Field                     | Type   | Encoding  | Required | Description                                    |
   | ...                       | ...    | ...       | ...      | ...                                            |
   | `ipnsPrivateKeyEncrypted` | string | hex       | Yes      | ECIES-wrapped 64-byte Ed25519 IPNS key...      |
   | `folderKeyEncrypted`      | string | hex       | Yes      | ECIES-wrapped 32-byte AES-256 folder key...    |

